# Depositphotos

> Depositphotos is a creative platform with millions of high-quality stock files: royalty-free images, videos, vectors, illustrations, music, and sound effects. Plus we offer unlimited AI-powered editing tools with every plan to speed up design workflow. Discover our large thematic collection of stock photography, and explore our stock video and music library to find exactly what you need for your projects. We're trusted by leading international companies that turn to our library for visual and audio content.

- [Depositphotos.com](https://depositphotos.com/): High-quality royalty-free stock photos, vector images, videos and music

## Features

> Depositphotos is a platform with 300+ million royalty-free files: photos, vectors, videos, and music. 5 million new uploads monthly. 600+ themed curated collections. Plus AI-powered editing tools to produce visuals from both text prompts and reference images and speed up creative workflow. Unlimited AI image generations with any plan. You can easily bring your ideas to life.

- [Stock Photography](https://depositphotos.com/stock-photography.html): Millions of royalty-free stock photos and images on every topic
